        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "无  衣 <sup>a</sup>"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 1
            },
            "bbox": [
                433,
                129,
                552,
                161
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "《诗经·秦风》"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                425,
                177,
                561,
                197
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "岂曰无衣？与子同袍 <sup>b</sup>。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                326,
                227,
                541,
                247
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "王于兴师<sup>c</sup>，修我戈矛，与子同仇<sup>d</sup>。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                326,
                252,
                655,
                272
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "岂曰无衣？与子同泽<sup>e</sup>。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                326,
                302,
                541,
                321
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "王于兴师，修我矛戟，与子偕作<sup>f</sup>。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                326,
                326,
                640,
                346
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "岂曰无衣？与子同裳。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                326,
                378,
                526,
                395
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "王于兴师，修我甲兵<sup>g</sup>，与子偕行。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                327,
                401,
                640,
                422
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "《无衣》产生于秦地。该诗反复咏唱：怎么能说没有衣服穿呢？我的衣服跟你共享。修好我们的铠甲和兵器，我跟你一同奔赴战场。诗歌既表现了慷慨赴敌、同仇敌忾的豪情，也表现了战士之间深厚的情谊。朱熹评价这首诗，强调它体现了秦人“尚气概，先勇力，忘生轻死”的气魄和“与子同仇”的“欢爱之心”（《诗集传》）。诵读这首诗，注意体会质朴诗句中蕴含的真挚情感。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                132,
                453,
                852,
                573
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "a 选自《诗经注析》（中华书局1991年版）。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                840,
                400,
                858
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "b〔袍〕长袍，类似于斗篷。行军者白天当衣服穿，晚上当被子盖。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                858,
                465,
                894
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "c〔王于兴师〕周王出兵打仗。于，句中助词。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                894,
                415,
                912
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "d〔同仇〕指共同对付敌人。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                840,
                719,
                858
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "e〔泽〕同“襗（zé）”，贴身穿的衣服。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                858,
                796,
                876
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "f〔偕作〕一同起来，指共同行动。作，起。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                876,
                823,
                894
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "g〔甲兵〕铠甲和兵器。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                894,
                690,
                912
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "content": {
                "page_number_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "102"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                97,
                939,
                132,
                954
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footer",
            "content": {
