    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "春江花月夜 <sup>a</sup>"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                416,
                130,
                594,
                164
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "张若虚"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                472,
                185,
                539,
                205
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "content": {
                "list_type": "text_list",
                "attribute": "unordered",
                "list_items": [
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "春江潮水连海平，海上明月共潮生。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "滟滟<sup>b</sup> 随波千万里，何处春江无月明<sup>c</sup>。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "江流宛转绕芳甸<sup>d</sup>，月照花林皆似霰<sup>e</sup>。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "空里流霜<sup>f</sup> 不觉飞，汀上白沙看不见。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "江天一色无纤尘，皎皎空中孤月轮。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "江畔何人初见月？江月何年初照人？人生代代无穷已，江月年年望相似。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "不知江月待何人，但见长江送流水。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "白云一片去悠悠，青枫浦<sup>g</sup> 上不胜愁。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "谁家今夜扁舟子<sup>h</sup> ？何处相思明月楼<sup>i</sup> ？ 可怜楼上月裴回<sup>j</sup>，应照离人<sup>k</sup> 妆镜台。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "玉户帘中卷不去<sup>l</sup>，捣衣砧上拂还来。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "此时相望不相闻，愿逐月华<sup>m</sup> 流照<sup>n</sup> 君。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "鸿雁长飞光不度<sup>o</sup>，鱼龙潜跃水成文<sup>p</sup>。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "昨夜闲潭梦落花，可怜春半不还家。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "江水流春去欲尽，江潭落月复西斜。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                326,
                235,
                689,
                631
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "a 选自《全唐诗》卷二十一（中华书局1999年版）。春江花月夜，乐府旧题。张若虚（约660—约720），扬州（今属江苏）人，唐代诗人。与贺知章、张旭、包融并称“吴中四士”。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                681,
                480,
                751
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "k〔离人〕指守候在家的思妇。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                681,
                746,
                699
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "b〔滟滟〕形容波光荡漾。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                752,
                292,
                770
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "l〔玉户帘中卷不去〕意思是，月光洒在玉门帘上，欲卷而去之而不得。玉户，用玉装饰的门，也用作门的美称。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                699,
                904,
                751
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "m〔月华〕月光。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                752,
                657,
                770
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "c〔月明〕月光。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                770,
                231,
                788
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "d〔芳甸〕花草茂盛的原野。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                788,
                309,
                806
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "n〔流照〕照射。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                770,
                658,
                788
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "e〔霰（xiàn）〕白色不透明的小冰粒。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                104,
                806,
                374,
                824
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "f〔流霜〕飞霜，比喻从空中洒落的月光。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                104,
                824,
                398,
                841
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "o〔鸿雁长飞光不度〕大雁远飞却不能飞出月光。暗示鸿雁不能传书。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                788,
                904,
                822
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "g〔青枫浦〕即双枫浦，在湖南浏阳南。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                841,
                384,
                859
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "h〔扁舟子〕指飘荡江湖的游子。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                859,
                339,
                877
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "i〔明月楼〕明月映照下的楼阁。这里指楼上的思妇。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                877,
                472,
                895
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "j〔裴回〕同“徘徊”。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                895,
                272,
                913
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "p〔鱼龙潜跃水成文〕鱼儿出没只能使水面泛出波纹。暗示鱼儿不能传书。古人有鱼儿传书一说。乐府诗《饮马长城窟行》：“呼儿烹鲤鱼，中有尺素书。”鱼龙，这里指鱼。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                824,
                904,
                895
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footer",
            "content": {
                "page_footer_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "古诗词诵读"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
