                697,
                838,
                717
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "j〔斗酒十千〕一斗酒值十千钱，指酒美而贵。"
                    }
